Tested by creating a local account with a fake email, then logging in through GitHub with an account whose real email did not match, confirming a new linked account was created under the GitHub username. Also tested the case where a local account's email matched the GitHub account's primary email, confirming login resolved to the existing local account rather than creating a new one. 

